&lt;li&gt;3–5 years of relevant design experience, ideally with a mix of in-house and agency backgrounds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio demonstrating strong craft across digital, brand, and campaign work, with clear evidence of web capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable executing across a wide variety of asset types and moving fluidly between campaign, digital, brand, and web work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Web fluency: not necessarily a UI/UX specialist, but comfortable with web-forward creative execution and able to show strong web work in your portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively uses AI tools as part of your creative practice, spanning ideation, production, and workflow. You bring genuine curiosity and a point of view on how AI can make your work better and faster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong foundational design skills: typography, color, composition, and visual storytelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Adobe Creative Suite, Figma, and similar design tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working from briefs and creative direction, with an ability to interpret ambiguity and ask the right clarifying questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills and the ability to manage multiple concurrent projects without dropping the ball.&lt;/li&gt;
