&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cultivate executive-level relationships&lt;/strong&gt; with key customers, prospects, and partners to accelerate business growth and strengthen Abnormal’s market position.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Oversee forecasting and performance metrics&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring accuracy, predictability, and operational excellence in revenue reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expand the partner ecosystem&lt;/strong&gt;, developing strategic relationships with new and existing channel partners to maximize regional impact.&lt;/li&gt;
