&lt;li&gt;Strong &lt;strong&gt;market analysis and business acumen&lt;/strong&gt;, with the ability to identify emerging opportunities and competitive trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in managing &lt;strong&gt;complex enterprise sales cycles&lt;/strong&gt; with multiple stakeholders and deal sizes of $100K–$500K+.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional leadership, communication, and organizational skills, with a passion for developing talent and scaling teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leveraging &lt;strong&gt;consultative and value-based sales methodologies&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., Force Management, Challenger Sale).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to &lt;strong&gt;operate effectively in a high-growth, fast-paced environment&lt;/strong&gt;, balancing strategic vision with hands-on execution.&lt;/li&gt;
