&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of Enterprise Sales experience with a demonstrated track record of success exceeding sales quotas selling security, networking and/or software solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years leading a sales team focused on growing new business and new logos&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hunter mentality: direct experience managing teams responsible for creating new demand, new customer acquisition, and sourcing new pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A winner, someone who holds themselves accountable to consistent over-achievement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Successful experience closing complex Enterprise sales with multiple buying influences in new or emerging solution categories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing and closing deals of $200K+ as well high value transactions above $1m+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience establishing and fostering strong relationships with potential partners and customers at executive levels&lt;/li&gt;
