&lt;li&gt;Meet or exceed monthly, quarterly and yearly targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively partner and work across sales teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the subject matter expert on Abnormal AI product offering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
