&lt;li&gt;0-1 year previous experience as a Sales Development or Business Development Representative OR related internship experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to collaborate with a distributed sales team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capability of understanding customer pain points, requirements and correlating potential business to value&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong, professional communication skills -- written, verbal, presentation&lt;/li&gt;
