&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a highly motivated sales development leader to join our organization as an SDR Manager for the SDR Team.&amp;nbsp; This leader will be responsible for all elements of team development – recruitment, hiring, and management of an SDR team, as well as driving pipeline growth and exceeding qualified meeting targets within their team. This is an exciting opportunity to join a cybersecurity market leader with an unparalleled growth trajectory. Our Sales Development function is the “tip of the spear” for that growth - are you ready?&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal Sales Development Manager candidate should have the perfect blend of experience as an SDR and/or AE, a desire to be challenged, a team oriented mindset, &amp;amp; a mentality of overachievement.The candidate will need to have exceptional organizational skills and the ability to manage multiple competing priorities. Strong written &amp;amp; verbal communication skills are also a must have. This role will also be responsible for interviewing, hiring, and training new and tenured SDRs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit and hire a world class team of SDR’s, on time and on budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clearly articulate, manage and enable SDR’s to hit all key productivity metrics and milestones of growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Instill a disciplined approach to pipeline generation leveraging both SDR and the greater sales ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop an overall SDR strategy for the region resulting in strong execution and collaborative team pipeline generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively forecast monthly / quarterly sales qualified pipeline to leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate Quarterly Business Reviews to measure SDR productivity, plan execution, and progress against strategic objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 2 years&amp;nbsp; SDR / SDR Manager / Account Executive experience with demonstrated track record of success exceeding quotas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hunter mentality: direct experience working with/managing teams responsible for creating new demand, new customer meetings, and sourcing new sales qualified pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A winner -, someone who holds themselves accountable to consistent over-achievement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Successful experience booking complex prospect meetings with multiple buying influences in new or emerging solution categories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience establishing and fostering strong relationships with potential partners and customers at executive levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation and communications skills, competent translating technical features into business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity and experience using consultative, value-based SDR methodologies (Force Management, Challenger Sale, BANT, etc.) is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding verbal, written, and presentation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
