&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to take an early-stage idea — where the goal is clear but the path isn&#39;t — and build it into structured delivery with measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to move fast and drive velocity — keeping programs progressing through ambiguity and unknowns.&lt;/li&gt;
