&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communicator across technical and non-technical audiences — written updates, verbal alignment, and executive readouts are all in your wheelhouse.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to drive accountability and alignment across teams without formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Engineering, Information Technology, Business Administration, Information Security or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
